<mjml lang="en">
  <mj-head>
    <!--
      PROBE — inline-first grid images vs stock fluid (2026-08-18).
      Not a catalog page. Send dist/probe_fullbleed-grid-images_live.html
      through EN to EoA and read android16_gmailapp_pixel10_lm FIRST, then
      iphone17_*, then Outlook desktop, then the delivered HTML
      (/app/acidtest/display/email_html/<TEST_ID>).

      WHY THIS EXISTS
      Test 3ZeoECY measured the EoA Gmail app (Android) rendering with the
      ENTIRE head <style> dropped: the fluid rules at byte offset 12.4K did
      not apply (before any 16KB clip point), the dark rules at 22.7K did
      not apply, the background painted Gmail's own #121212 auto-dark (not
      the template's #000000), while column stacking — inline styles — was
      intact. Consequence: every grid image that relies on head CSS
      (mj-full-width-mobile) to scale renders at its authored attribute
      width in Gmail app: Images 2x1 at 292px, Images 3x1 at 184px,
      centered in full-width stacked columns. iPhone/Apple Mail apply the
      CSS and render full-bleed. This is the same reality behind guide §2c
      (the dark-mode swap "cannot fire" in Gmail app) applied to layout.

      THE CANDIDATE (the §2a inline-first doctrine applied to images)
      The no-CSS rendering must be the correct MOBILE rendering:
        - wrapper <table width="100%" style="width:100%"> (fills the
          stacked column with no CSS at all)
        - <img width="292" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto">
          — the ATTRIBUTE is for Word/Outlook (which ignores the inline
          width:100%), the inline style is for everyone else
        - desktop containment comes from layers Gmail app never breaks:
          the min-width:600px column classes (CSS-capable clients) and the
          MSO conditional cells (Outlook)

      CLAIMS
        F1  Gmail app mobile: candidate images run edge-to-edge of the
            stacked column (full-bleed); the CONTROL stays at its attribute
            width, centered. If both stay narrow, the candidate is refuted.
        F2  CSS-capable desktop (Apple Mail wide, webmail ≥600px): the
            candidate sits at its column width — identical to the control.
            If the candidate overflows or letterboxes, the column cap
            failed.
        F3  Outlook desktop (Word engine): candidate renders at the img
            ATTRIBUTE width inside its MSO cell — no stretch, no blowout.
        F4  Delivered HTML: EN's inliner leaves inline `width:` on img and
            table intact (the vertical-align→valign precedent says EN
            rewrites SOME styles to attributes; width is unmeasured).
        F5  The pattern holds at all three shapes: 2-col (292), 3-col
            (184), 2x2 grid (248, 50% columns).

      VARIANTS (read the big letter labels in the renders)
        A  CONTROL 2-col  — today's Images 2x1 markup verbatim
                            (fluid-on-mobile + flush-mobile-capflush).
                            Predicts 292px centered in Gmail app.
        B  CANDIDATE 2-col — same columns, inline-first images.
                            Predicts full-bleed in Gmail app.
        C  CANDIDATE 3-col — 200px columns, attr 184.
        D  CANDIDATE 2x2  — 50% columns, attr 248, two rows.
    -->
    <mj-breakpoint width="600px" />
    <mj-title>PROBE fullbleed-grid-images</mj-title>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Tahoma, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" line-height="24px" color="#000000" padding="0" />
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" />
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#e8e8e8" width="600px">

    <!-- identify the send -->
    <mj-section padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text align="center">
          <p style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">PROBE fullbleed-grid-images — 2026-08-18</p>
          <p style="font-size:14px;">Read A vs B on Gmail app Android first. A narrow = expected control. B narrow = candidate refuted.</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ================= A — CONTROL: stock fluid 2-col ================= -->
    <mj-section padding="8px 32px" background-color="#CEE4C5">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;">A — CONTROL fluid 2-col</p></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="two-col-images-block block flush-mobile-capflush" background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column first-column" width="300px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 8px 0 0">
        <mj-image src="assets/photo-family.jpg" alt="Control left" href="https://www.example.com" width="292px" align="center" padding="0 0 8px" fluid-on-mobile="true" />
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column" width="300px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 0 0 8px">
        <mj-image src="assets/photo-forest.jpg" alt="Control right" href="https://www.example.com" width="292px" align="center" padding="0 0 8px" fluid-on-mobile="true" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ================ B — CANDIDATE: inline-first 2-col ================ -->
    <mj-section padding="8px 32px" background-color="#CEE4C5">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;">B — CANDIDATE inline-first 2-col</p></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="two-col-images-block block flush-mobile-capflush" background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column first-column" width="300px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 8px 0 0">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 8px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-family.jpg" alt="Candidate left" width="292" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column" width="300px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 0 0 8px">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 8px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-forest.jpg" alt="Candidate right" width="292" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ================ C — CANDIDATE: inline-first 3-col ================ -->
    <mj-section padding="8px 32px" background-color="#CEE4C5">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;">C — CANDIDATE inline-first 3-col</p></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="three-col-images-block block flush-mobile-capflush" background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column first-column" width="200px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 8px">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 8px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-kayak.jpg" alt="Candidate three left" width="184" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column second-column" width="200px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 8px">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 8px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-hiking-duo.jpg" alt="Candidate three middle" width="184" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column css-class="two-col-column" width="200px" vertical-align="middle" padding="0 8px">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 8px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-trail.jpg" alt="Candidate three right" width="184" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- ================ D — CANDIDATE: inline-first 2x2 grid ================ -->
    <mj-section padding="8px 32px" background-color="#CEE4C5">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:700;">D — CANDIDATE inline-first 2x2 grid</p></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="image-block block flush-mobile-capflush" background-color="#362229" padding="8px 32px 0">
      <mj-column width="50%" vertical-align="top" padding="0 8px 0 0">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-person-and-bird-1.png" alt="Grid one" width="248" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="50%" vertical-align="top" padding="0 0 0 8px">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-person-and-bird-2.png" alt="Grid two" width="248" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section css-class="image-block block flush-mobile-capflush" background-color="#362229" padding="0 32px 8px">
      <mj-column width="50%" vertical-align="top" padding="0 8px 0 0">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-person-and-bird-3.png" alt="Grid three" width="248" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="50%" vertical-align="top" padding="0 0 0 8px">
        <mj-raw><table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width:100%;"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px;"><a href="https://www.example.com" target="_blank"><img src="assets/photo-person-and-bird-4.png" alt="Grid four" width="248" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;" /></a></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- reading card -->
    <mj-section padding="16px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>
          <p style="font-size:14px;"><b>Verdict sheet.</b> Gmail app Android: A narrow + B/C/D full-bleed proves the candidate (F1/F5). Apple Mail wide: B/C/D identical to A at column width (F2). Outlook desktop: B/C/D at 292/184/248px, no stretching (F3). Then diff the delivered HTML for rewritten width styles (F4).</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
